                        "glosses": [
                            "Outside of metaphysics."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6dc2a45-ddda-479a-b83c-bd56aa04bf71",
                                "sense_id": "226a2465-2f19-3262-bdbe-186e1822ac65",
                                "text": "To me that Arius, whose mind was acute and extrametaphysical, determined to resolve a question that cannot be explained, and, finding he could not, refused to hold it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49154e24-e966-4831-a68e-27986d6bc8e6",
                                "sense_id": "226a2465-2f19-3262-bdbe-186e1822ac65",
                                "text": "We must admit that Shpet’s ‘extrametaphysical’ position is closer to pure Husserlianism. Losev, however, supplements phenomenology with dialectic because he is a metaphysician prior to any ‘strict’ method."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e605658-49c8-4dc0-9c53-a0e08f7cbac0",
                                "sense_id": "226a2465-2f19-3262-bdbe-186e1822ac65",
                                "text": "Always working within metaphysics, Derrida is nonetheless committed to think the impossible, the extrametaphysical thought."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
